 so  the first thing is passive income what  is it second thing is how much do you  need then how much can you bring that  down to and then the third step is let's  say right now you're thinking I need two  grand a month in passive income the  third thing you need to do is you need  to absolutely ingrain on your brain that  figure  and set out to earn that figure in  passive income and you could do this a  number of ways you could do this by if  you haven't got the money to start  buying properties and investing huge  amounts of money because making two  grand a month you don't need I mean if  you've got a few hundred thousand pounds  you can just invest that into regular  property investing and the rental income  will make you financially free if you've  not got a hundred thousand pounds to  start with then you can do things like  rent to rent so you can rent properties  but then rent them out a much higher  amount by splitting them up or putting  them on Airbnb with obviously the right  permission in place that's then going to  give you a recurring passive income if  you structure it right so two grand  three grand four grand whatever it is  you need to start thinking forget  replacing or exchanging my time with  money forget trying to work harder how  can I work smarter how can I make the  same amount of money but in passive  income and once you do that and you get  to the point whereby you don't need to  go to work anymore then guess what  you're not rich but you're financially  free and when you're financially free  you know you can do with all your time  go get rich do what you love and  hopefully leave the world a better place  than you found it  [Music]

